// This project's choices: the target and the C standard, spelled out per tool because a
// tool's settings are complete where they are written. The machine's half — the tools and
// the SDK — is ../semel.machine.config, written by `semel tools --write`, never edited.
//
// Values are literal: everything after the first `=` is the value, quotes included.

clang.preprocessor.target=arm64-apple-macos14.0
clang.preprocessor.cStandard=c17

clang.compiler.target=arm64-apple-macos14.0
clang.compiler.cStandard=c17

clang.linker.target=arm64-apple-macos14.0
